  "analysis_md": "$u_x=\\frac{\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}-x\\cdot2x\\cdot\\frac12(x^2+y^2)^{-\\frac12}}{x^2+y^2}=\\frac{y^2}{(x^2+y^2)^{\\frac32}}$，$u_y=\\frac{-xy}{(x^2+y^2)^{\\frac32}}$，则 $u_x^2+u_y^2=\\frac{y^4}{(x^2+y^2)^3}+\\frac{x^2y^2}{(x^2+y^2)^3}=\\frac{y^2}{(x^2+y^2)^2}$",
